<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#c6f1f4">
  <title>三界物价录 · 梦幻个人物价助手</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="bright-overrides.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="sky-layer" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand-seal" aria-hidden="true">三<br>界</div>
    <div class="brand-copy"><p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL MARKET LEDGER</p><h1>三界物价录</h1><p class="subtitle">珍宝阁 · 个人行情玉简</p></div>
    <div class="status"><span class="status-dot"></span><span id="generatedAt">等待数据</span></div>
  </header>
  <nav class="tabs" aria-label="主导航"><div class="primary-tabs" role="group" aria-label="核心结论"><button class="tab primary-tab active" data-view="prices">物价玉简</button><button class="tab primary-tab" data-view="points">积分兑换</button><button class="tab primary-tab" data-view="dungeon-shenqi">玩法收益</button></div><span class="tab-divider maint-only" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="secondary-tabs maint-only" role="group" aria-label="规则与编辑"><button class="tab secondary-tab" data-view="quote">一图报价</button><button class="tab secondary-tab" data-view="settings">藏经阁</button><button class="tab secondary-tab" data-view="terms">规则校对</button><button class="tab secondary-tab" data-view="review">勘误 <span id="pendingBadge" class="badge">0</span></button></div></nav>
  <main>
    <section id="view-prices" class="view active">
      <div class="hero-grid"><article class="metric"><span>观测周期</span><strong>三十日</strong><small>往昔样本仍存于卷宗</small></article><article class="metric"><span>在录珍品</span><strong id="itemCount">0</strong><small>拥有有效行情的物品</small></article><article class="metric"><span>有效行情</span><strong id="quoteCount">0</strong><small>勘误前不计入物价</small></article></div>
      <section class="matrix-controls panel-jade"><div class="category-block"><span class="control-label">品类灵签</span><div id="categoryChips" class="category-chips"></div></div><div class="matrix-search-wrap"><label class="matrix-search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="priceSearch" placeholder="寻物或寻类…" autocomplete="off"></label><button id="clearHighlight" class="text-button" hidden>清除灵光</button><span id="matchCount" class="match-count">展示全部物价</span><button id="refreshButton" class="button primary maint-only">导入并刷新</button></div></section>
      <section class="price-section buy-section"><header class="section-banner"><div><p class="eyebrow">MERCHANT BUYING</p><h2>商人收购价</h2><p>快速变现参考 · 主牌显示近三十日收购中位数</p></div><span class="section-emblem">收</span></header><div id="buyMatrix" class="category-matrix"></div><div id="buyEmpty" class="empty">暂无商人收购行情。</div></section>
      <div class="cloud-divider" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
      <section class="price-section sell-section"><header class="section-banner"><div><p class="eyebrow">PLAYER SELLING</p><h2>玩家出售价</h2><p>挂售行情参考 · 仅陈列拥有出售价样本的珍品</p></div><span class="section-emblem">售</span></header><div id="sellMatrix" class="category-matrix"></div><div id="sellEmpty" class="empty">当前卷宗尚未收录玩家出售价。</div></section>
    </section>
    <section id="view-quote" class="view"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRICE CARD</p><h2>一图报价</h2></div><p class="muted">这里只保留最后一次生成的商人收购价图片，可随时重新生成、复制或保存。</p></div><div class="panel scroll-panel quote-page-panel"><div class="quote-page-actions"><button id="quoteImageButton" class="button primary">生成一图报价</button><button id="copyQuoteImage" class="button ghost">复制图片</button><button id="saveQuoteImage" class="button ghost">保存图片</button></div><canvas id="quoteImageCanvas"></canvas><div id="quoteImageEmpty" class="empty">尚未生成一图报价。</div></div></section>
    <section id="view-settings" class="view"><div class="split"><article class="panel scroll-panel"><p class="eyebrow">ARCHIVE</p><h2>历次卷宗</h2><p class="muted">新�